{"timestamp": 1779351969.661087, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 20, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779351983.6943672, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Eve's body in Medbay when I circled back there just now. For my route, I started in Medbay, then went to Electrical, Security, Weapons, Cafeteria, and finally back to Medbay where I tripped over Eve. \n\nAs for who I saw: I ran into Bob in Weapons around tick 14 to 16. Frank was with me in Electrical early on, then I saw him in Security, and he left Weapons heading towards Cafeteria around tick 16. \n\nI haven't seen Charlie at all this entire round. Charlie, where have you been? Bob and Frank, did you see anyone else on your side of the ship? We need to figure out who could have been in Medbay, and I'm guessing Charlie is our main unknown right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351999.0622807, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I can vouch for almost all of Diana's route. I saw her leave Medbay for Electrical very early on, then head to Security. I was also with her in Weapons around ticks 14 to 16. \n\nFrank, I can vouch for you too. I was in Electrical with you around ticks 7 to 9, and later I saw you move from Weapons through Cafeteria, and we were together in Oxygen right when the meeting was called. \n\nSince I didn't see Eve or Alice all round, Eve must have been killed in Medbay either very early before we all cleared out of there, or while Diana, Frank, and I were grouped up on the right side of the ship (Weapons/Security area). \n\nCharlie, you're the only one unaccounted for. Both Diana and I haven't seen you at all. Where have you been, and did you see Alice or Eve?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779352020.9136415, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I totally understand why I look like the odd one out here, but I was just stuck on the bottom side of the ship doing my tasks. My route was Navigation, down to Storage, and then I slowly made my way up through Cafeteria and just arrived in Weapons. \n\nI did actually see Alice very early on in Navigation around tick 8, and she was alive when I left her. I never set foot in Medbay this round, so I couldn't have killed Eve. \n\nIt sounds like Diana, Bob, and Frank have all been vouching for each other on the right side of the map. That means whoever killed Eve likely did it very early on before you all grouped up and moved right. I know I'm the easy target because I was alone, but since we're down to 4 players, a wrong vote here is incredibly dangerous. I'm a Goose, so voting me would be a mistake. I strongly suggest we skip this vote, stick together as a group of four next round, and we'll easily win or catch the real Impostor. I'm more than happy to follow any of you."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352057.3344758, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Bob and Diana, your stories are completely solid and match my observations perfectly. I can confirm both of your early movements: I saw Diana leave Electrical for Security at tick 8, and Bob leave Electrical for Cafeteria at tick 9. I also saw both of you in the Security and Weapons area later on. The three of us are clear.\n\nCharlie, you just caught yourself in a massive lie. You claimed you went from Storage up to Cafeteria, but you also explicitly stated, 'I never set foot in Medbay this round.' Look at the ship's layout\u2014there is no direct path from Storage to Cafeteria or Electrical. The ONLY way north from Storage is right through Medbay! You had to have walked through there to get to Cafeteria. You're lying about your route to avoid admitting you were in the exact room where Eve was killed. \n\nYou also admitted you were the last one to see Alice in Navigation, and since she's dead too, it's obvious what happened. You killed Alice down south, killed Eve in Medbay while moving up, and now you're lying about your path because you didn't realize the map connections trapped you. \n\nWe are not skipping this. The lie is completely exposed. Charlie is the Duck, let's vote him out right now and win."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352068.2528765, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Charlie"}}
{"timestamp": 1779352074.956715, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Charlie"}}
{"timestamp": 1779352086.9588547, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Frank, you're completely twisting my words! When I said I 'never set foot in Medbay,' I obviously meant I didn't stop or spend any time in there doing tasks. Yes, I walked through the room to get from Storage to Cafeteria, but I was just passing through as fast as I could and I didn't see a body. Eve might have been killed in a corner or I just missed it in my rush. You guys are jumping on a poor choice of phrasing to tunnel vision on me. I really hope you reconsider because voting me out right now loses us the game!\n\nFrank"}}
